    "title": " Dr Farouk Topan Honoured at the BARAZA Conference",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Dr Farouk Topan was honoured this week at the BARAZA conference, focusing on Swahili studies, SOAS.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "8260c23e8a355da4",
        "component": "news_media",
